4	//! A Model represents a named model (e.g., "llama-3-70b") that may be served by
5	//! one or more WorkerSets. Each WorkerSet corresponds to a namespace.
6	//!
7	//! Requests are routed to a WorkerSet selected by weighted random (proportional to worker count).
8	
