615	    /// `is_prefill_set` must exclude every serving-engine field on `WorkerSet`. If a new
616	    /// engine variant is added without updating `is_prefill_set`, a worker that registers
617	    /// only that engine would be misclassified as prefill — silent and easy to miss in
618	    /// integration tests. This walks each engine in isolation so the failing arm names
619	    /// itself.
620	    #[test]
