4	//! The serving-readiness contract shared by the request plane and the KV DC Relay.
5	//!
6	//! Both consumers must answer "can this namespace serve this model" identically, so the
7	//! card normalization and the readiness evaluation live here as pure functions over
8	//! [`ReadinessUnit`]s; `Model::evaluate_namespace` and the relay topology projection are
9	//! adapters that build units from their own liveness sources.
